Hello,

   I posted earlier asking how to kill a cockatrice and received a number
of helpful tips -- the best solution we have found is to kill them off
using a scroll of genocide.  We have been able to kill other monsters
rather easily (relatively speaking) when we have characters in good
condition, but the cockatrice has been particularly difficult to master.
   
   But wait!  There's more!  Questions, that is.  We have killed off
a few long worms and then picked up "a worm tooth".  Supposedly a
crysknife can be manufactured from this.  How?  
   REMEMBER:  We are NOT playing Nethack.  We are playing hack 1.0.2
on a Sun Sparc.  I repeat:  we are not playing Nethack version whatever.
   Let's see... what else?  When a purple worm eats you, is it possible
to kill it from the inside?  Would a scroll of teleportation help?
   How many levels are there?  We have been down to level 15 so far.
Is a ring of increase damage good or bad?  It doesn't seem to be cursed,
so I am assuming it increases the damage your character inflicts... NOT
the damage that is inflicted on you by other creatures.
   We haven't come upon a unicorn yet, but if we do, should be attack it?
Can we do something with its horn?

   I also have a list of tips for people new to hack.  If you want it,
mail me and I will try to get it to you.  We add to it a bit every
time we play.  It mentions very obvious things and not-so-obvious
things... we have found about 10 ways to steal from a shopkeeper.

   Just to put things in perspective, the version of hack we are playing
doesn't have keystone kops, cockatrices immediately turn you to
stone (you don't "start to stiffen" first), and no priests or altars (yet),


   Thanks very much for all the tips... mail me if you have info or
would like a copy of the tips.  If you are experienced with the game, the
tips will be very basic, but it might be a good thing to give to a player
who is just starting out.

